# Compiled translation catalogs. JTranslate writes these from the phrase table
# (TranslationsTable::writePhpTranslationArrays), so they are build output, not
# source: `jtranslate:export-catalogs` rebuilds them and a hand edit is discarded
# on the next write.
#
# They also must not be committed here for a reason specific to a *shared* library.
# The phrase table is shared between the applications that install this module, and
# the catalogs that used to sit here were exported from patres, not from
# schoenstatt.link — the four files removed alongside this line were `project =
# Patres` rows, so this repository was carrying one installation's data to every
# other installation. Phrases are arbitrary text taken from whatever an application
# renders and can carry things its users never agreed to publish elsewhere.
/language/
